    "fullText": "During this transit, your attention turns toward your one-on-one relationships and how you project yourself onto others [1, 2]. You may encounter people who oppose your goals, or you might find that you need another person to help you clearly see your own path [3]. It is a period that tests your ability to compromise and maintain your core identity while cooperating with a partner."
