    "fullText": "At this time, you will seek increased mental stimulation through contacts with others, whether through lively conversation or friendly debate [5]. It is an excellent transit for consulting experts, seeking advice, or negotiating business deals and contracts because your mind is clear and geared toward finding mutual understanding [5, 6]. Communication with a spouse or close partner is also highly favored, making it a great time to clear the air [6]."
