    "fullText": "During this period, you seek to grow in various ways through your closest contacts with other people [9]. You try to create relationships that will further your life in a spirit of mutual growth rather than selfishness [9]. Often, a person will come into your life who offers to help you out in some way, making this an extremely good time to enter into a business partnership, sign a contract, or deepen a personal bond [9]."
