    "fullText": "This transit forces you to evaluate the structures and commitments within your one-on-one relationships. You may feel that others are blocking your path or that a partner is being overly critical and restrictive [10]. Relationships that are weak or superficial may break under this pressure, while strong ones will be forced to mature and redefine their boundaries [11]. You must take responsibility for your commitments and face the reality of your partnerships."
